Package: ckanr
Title: Client for the Comprehensive Knowledge Archive Network ('CKAN')
Description: Client for the Comprehensive Knowledge Archive Network
    ('CKAN') application programming interface ('API') (<https://ckan.org/>).
    Includes interface to 'CKAN' 'APIs' for search, list, show for packages,
    organizations, and resources. In addition, provides an interface to the
    'datastore' extension.
Version: 0.9.1
